[sliver] These are the closed outer ends of the 1.50 mm thick sideways wing slots, backed by the coupon's full side stock. The slots receive 1.20 mm wings with 0.30 mm thickness air. They are cavities, not thin freestanding rails. Native support paths do not enter either slot.
